WEBVTT

01:22.400 --> 01:23.970
Hello?

01:23.970 --> 01:26.100
Merry Christmas!

01:26.540 --> 01:27.900
What is it?

01:27.900 --> 01:29.020
Mama?

01:29.610 --> 01:34.570
Momoka's Christmas

01:34.570 --> 01:38.700
It's a little early, but I wanted to hear your voice, so I decided to call you.

01:43.370 --> 01:48.340
What?! So you've finally made it as a member of the flight crew?!

01:48.340 --> 01:49.700
Congratulations, Mama!

01:49.700 --> 01:52.350
Miyu, you're so quick to jump to conclusions.

01:52.350 --> 01:54.610
I hope you're right, but...

01:54.610 --> 01:58.450
I don't think we'll be able to come home for Christmas.

01:58.450 --> 02:00.790
I'm fine here. Don't worry about us.

02:00.790 --> 02:03.890
However, I did send you a Christmas present, okay?

02:03.890 --> 02:05.720
Present?

02:07.060 --> 02:07.560
Pepo?!

02:07.560 --> 02:08.840
No! Pepo!

02:08.840 --> 02:10.630
What? Pepo?

02:10.630 --> 02:13.650
I'm sorry, Mama. We've got visitors.

02:13.650 --> 02:14.110
I'll talk to you later.

02:14.110 --> 02:15.180
Miyu?

02:16.440 --> 02:19.680
You think it's childish, right?

02:19.680 --> 02:22.410
But you know, she is a child, so there's no helping it.

02:22.410 --> 02:23.330
Chris-chan!

02:22.410 --> 02:23.670
Hanakomachi.

02:23.670 --> 02:24.530
Chris...

02:25.040 --> 02:28.210
Yes! The problem is Christmas!

02:28.210 --> 02:33.840
If I'd known this would happen, I would've tried to get rid of Christmas...

02:33.840 --> 02:36.840
No! That won't solve anything!

02:36.840 --> 02:38.340
Um...

02:38.340 --> 02:42.470
What am I going to do?!

02:43.760 --> 02:45.740
I apologize for losing my composure.

02:45.740 --> 02:47.300
What on earth's happened?

02:47.300 --> 02:49.870
Actually, Momoka-chan's parents...

02:49.870 --> 02:52.150
That is, my aunt and uncle,

02:52.150 --> 02:56.780
have to go overseas on a business trip because they're working on something for my parents.

02:56.780 --> 03:01.080
So, Momoka-chan will be staying at my house over Christmas.

03:01.080 --> 03:01.740
Meaning?

03:01.740 --> 03:04.340
As I said, Momoka-chan's parents,

03:04.340 --> 03:06.720
that is, my aunt and uncle,

03:06.720 --> 03:10.910
have to go overseas on a business trip because they're working on something for my parents.

03:11.210 --> 03:15.180
In other words, she'll be spending Christmas with Momoka-chan.

03:15.180 --> 03:15.920
I see.

03:16.850 --> 03:20.710
I want to make this a fun Christmas for her,

03:20.710 --> 03:24.850
so I told her I'd get her anything she wants as a present.

03:24.850 --> 03:25.890
I see.

03:25.890 --> 03:28.070
And then, Momoka-chan...

03:28.800 --> 03:32.600
said she'd already asked Santa so she doesn't need anything else!

03:33.070 --> 03:34.090
Chris-chan?

03:34.090 --> 03:35.810
Y-You don't have to cry...

03:35.810 --> 03:42.400
But she asked if she could ride his sleigh in the sky at night!

03:43.560 --> 03:45.390
That's just like Momoka-chan.

03:45.390 --> 03:47.950
This isn't anything to laugh about!

03:47.950 --> 03:54.700
And just now, there was a very friendly atmosphere between Miyu-chan and Kanata-kun...

03:54.700 --> 03:55.830
What on earth are you talking about?

03:56.290 --> 03:57.860
Then that's fine...

03:57.860 --> 04:03.340
If Momoka-chan's request doesn't reach Santa... what am I going to do?

04:03.340 --> 04:09.510
After all, Santa's busiest day of the year is Christmas.

04:09.510 --> 04:16.780
Even if Momoka-chan has asked for it, a ride on his sleigh at night might be a little difficult.

04:17.610 --> 04:19.410
Exactly.

04:19.410 --> 04:23.950
If Momoka-chan's wish doesn't come true, she'll be so disappointed.

04:23.950 --> 04:30.740
And when I thought of that, I just couldn't stay still any more, so I came over.

04:29.150 --> 04:31.290
We understand the situation, Chris-chan.

04:31.290 --> 04:32.560
Please leave it to us.

04:32.560 --> 04:33.600
Miyu-chan...

04:33.600 --> 04:35.540
Is it okay to say something like that?

04:35.540 --> 04:37.710
I've got an idea.

04:42.740 --> 04:45.180
So, someone dresses up as Santa

04:45.180 --> 04:49.340
and takes Momoka-chan on a sleigh ride is what I'm thinking.

04:49.340 --> 04:52.820
Isn't that lying to Momoka-chan?

04:53.530 --> 04:55.940
No! This isn't a lie!

04:55.940 --> 04:57.720
It's reality in the form of a performance!

04:57.720 --> 04:59.530
Furthermore, it's something that can be performed,

04:59.530 --> 05:04.070
not on the stage, but in the real world. The ultimate performance!

05:04.990 --> 05:09.370
Plus, we have someone here who was practically born to be Santa!

05:10.160 --> 05:11.910
I see. When you say Santa...

05:12.700 --> 05:14.750
Of course! Santa!

05:14.750 --> 05:18.290
After all, my name is Kurosu Santa.

05:18.290 --> 05:20.710
If you reverse it, it's Santa Kurosu!

05:21.080 --> 05:25.320
Born on 25th December, Saionji Kanata-kun!

05:21.080 --> 05:24.470
But I wonder if I'll be able to fill the role...

05:25.770 --> 05:28.200
Kanata-kun's going to be Santa Claus?

05:28.200 --> 05:29.990
What a fantastic idea!

05:29.990 --> 05:30.640
Right? Right?

05:30.640 --> 05:32.670
I'm going to be Santa Claus?

05:32.670 --> 05:36.040
I don't think we'll be able to stop Aya-chan now.

05:36.040 --> 05:37.850
It'll be fine. Just go with it. Go with it.

05:37.850 --> 05:42.730
If everyone helps make the sleigh, the reindeer can be Shikada-san and Mikan-san.

05:42.730 --> 05:45.550
We'll ask them to provide their own costumes.

05:45.550 --> 05:47.480
I wonder if I can finish the script in time?!

05:47.480 --> 05:48.280
I guess I'll have to!

05:48.620 --> 05:52.240
Even if we do all this, there's no way we can make the sleigh fly.

05:52.240 --> 05:53.580
Oh, that's right.

05:53.580 --> 05:57.290
Momoka-chan's wish was to fly in the sky on a sleigh at night.

05:57.290 --> 05:59.980
Can't we somehow make it fly at least as high as the ceiling?

06:00.210 --> 06:01.420
Midair stunts, eh?

06:01.420 --> 06:04.180
Then, let's make the ceiling the sky!

06:05.110 --> 06:10.020
We can put a blackout curtain and transform the ceiling into a sky, like in a planetarium.

06:10.020 --> 06:12.490
Kurosu-kun's good at those sorts of things.

06:12.490 --> 06:14.390
You can leave these things to me!

06:21.220 --> 06:23.030
Oh! This is good! This is good!

06:23.030 --> 06:24.480
Let me help too!

06:24.480 --> 06:27.490
Even so, isn't Christmas Eve tomorrow?

06:27.970 --> 06:29.430
I wonder if we'll make it in time?

06:29.010 --> 06:30.150
We'll have to!

06:30.150 --> 06:32.640
Stop talking and move your hands!

06:32.640 --> 06:33.870
Move your hands!

06:36.250 --> 06:38.830
[Text: Christmas Eve]

06:38.840 --> 06:41.830
As always, Hanakomachi-san's house is huge.

06:40.380 --> 06:41.830
Good evening!

06:41.830 --> 06:43.620
We've been waiting for you.

06:43.620 --> 06:45.750
Thank you for coming.

06:45.750 --> 06:49.660
Thank you for taking the role of reindeer today.

06:49.660 --> 06:53.130
Of course. If you don't mind a deer such as myself.

06:53.130 --> 06:55.610
I'm a red-nosed deer.

06:55.610 --> 06:56.790
Good!

06:56.790 --> 07:00.350
Mikan-san, the other reindeer, will be arriving later.

07:00.630 --> 07:01.520
Where's Momoka-chan?

07:01.520 --> 07:03.140
Well...

07:07.700 --> 07:11.580
She said it would be bad if Santa couldn't find her,

07:11.580 --> 07:14.370
so she's been making a flag to mark her spot since this morning.

07:16.460 --> 07:21.040
Somehow, I'd like to make Momoka-chan's wish come true.

07:23.250 --> 07:26.510
Miyu-chan, the school's a little more to the right.

07:26.510 --> 07:27.830
Is this okay?

07:27.830 --> 07:28.870
Okay!

07:28.870 --> 07:31.470
Ah! It's like a snake!

07:31.470 --> 07:33.980
Aya, did we have an apartment like this around here?

07:33.980 --> 07:37.030
It's the Heiho Plaza that was completed last month in 4th street.

07:37.030 --> 07:38.490
Ah...

07:38.490 --> 07:41.670
Ah! It's finally finished.

07:42.410 --> 07:46.400
I guess it can't be helped that the real thing is far cuter.

07:49.450 --> 07:53.310
Shikada-san! Chris onee-chan!

07:53.310 --> 07:57.240
This is weird. I wonder where they are?

07:57.620 --> 07:59.500
I wonder what that sound is?

08:00.280 --> 08:02.030
It's locked.

08:02.030 --> 08:04.460
Open the door! Please open the door!

08:04.460 --> 08:06.330
There's someone in here, isn't there?

08:06.330 --> 08:09.380
Please open the door!

08:07.690 --> 08:09.380
Please leave this to me.

08:09.380 --> 08:12.690
I said, open the door!

08:12.690 --> 08:17.960
Miss Momoka, it's almost your bedtime.

08:17.960 --> 08:19.750
Let's go to your room.

08:19.750 --> 08:21.430
Wait, Shikada-san.

08:21.430 --> 08:23.750
You're hiding something in there, aren't you?

08:23.750 --> 08:25.100
Confess!

08:25.100 --> 08:26.920
You noticed?

08:26.920 --> 08:30.480
We can't get anything pass Miss Momoka.

08:30.480 --> 08:33.650
That's right. A woman's intuition is sharp.

08:33.980 --> 08:38.020
It's something you'd find out sooner or later anyway.

08:38.020 --> 08:39.620
I'll tell you then.

08:39.620 --> 08:41.300
What is it?! What is it?!

08:41.300 --> 08:46.940
Actually, everyone's been planning a surprise Christmas party.

08:46.940 --> 08:49.840
A surprise Christmas party?

08:49.840 --> 08:58.760
In order to surprise Miss Momoka, we planned a surprise Christmas party!

08:58.760 --> 09:02.090
Oh, is that so?

09:03.080 --> 09:07.390
Then I won't look in this room.

09:07.390 --> 09:11.480
After all, everyone's trying to surprise me, right?

09:11.480 --> 09:14.570
If you could do that, I'd be very grateful.

09:14.570 --> 09:19.590
Oh, Shikada-san, can you please put up the flag I have at the back?

09:19.590 --> 09:21.120
As you wish.

09:24.580 --> 09:28.890
I wonder if Santa-san will come visit Momoka.

09:28.890 --> 09:30.960
It'll be fine.

09:34.010 --> 09:39.870
Now, Miss Momoka, if you don't get some rest now,

09:39.870 --> 09:44.430
you'll be sleepy on your ride with Santa.

09:46.560 --> 09:47.390
That's true.

09:48.080 --> 09:50.510
It seems like we'll make it in time.

09:50.510 --> 09:53.790
There were several times when I thought we wouldn't finish in time,

09:53.790 --> 09:56.150
but I guess everything turned out after all.

09:56.150 --> 09:58.270
Now we just need to wait for the actual performance.

09:58.270 --> 09:59.610
I'm looking forward to it!

09:59.610 --> 10:02.160
Oh, this is wonderful!

10:02.160 --> 10:03.600
Where's Momoka-chan?

10:03.600 --> 10:07.840
Miss Chris is putting her to bed right now.

10:07.840 --> 10:11.080
She's late. I wonder where Mikan-san is?

10:11.080 --> 10:12.910
Anyway, time's run out.

10:12.910 --> 10:15.910
Miyu-chan, take care of Kanata-kun's costume and makeup.

10:15.910 --> 10:17.440
So I have to do it?

10:17.440 --> 10:18.840
What are you talking about?

10:19.290 --> 10:24.140
And the prince and princess lived happily ever after.

10:24.140 --> 10:29.150
And the mean witch sort of lived happily ever after too.

10:29.150 --> 10:31.360
All ends well. The end.

10:33.200 --> 10:34.980
Can't sleep, Momoka-chan?

10:36.360 --> 10:37.510
I see.

10:41.290 --> 10:46.360
Nen'neko koro koro kororin rin~

10:46.360 --> 10:51.380
Kone kone kon koro koronegoro~

10:51.380 --> 10:53.710
What's that song?

10:54.840 --> 10:58.920
When I was small and I couldn't sleep, Shikada-san used to sing this to me.

11:00.410 --> 11:03.600
You also had times like this, Chris onee-chan?

11:03.600 --> 11:08.660
Nen'neko koro koro kororin rin~

11:08.660 --> 11:13.150
Kone kone kon koro koronegoro~

11:13.630 --> 11:18.570
Nen'neko koro koro neko riro rin~

11:18.570 --> 11:23.050
Momoka-chan's a good girl. Now, sleep.

11:23.680 --> 11:26.320
Nen'neko koro koro~

11:26.320 --> 11:28.580
The land of dreams~

11:28.580 --> 11:33.740
Momoka-chan's a good girl. Now, sleep.

11:33.740 --> 11:39.670
Momoka-chan's a good girl. Now, sleep.

11:46.670 --> 11:50.750
If we trick her like this and she wishes to fly again next year,

11:50.750 --> 11:54.480
won't we have to deceive Momoka-chan year after year then?

11:54.480 --> 11:56.150
What do you mean by trick?

11:56.150 --> 11:57.690
What do you mean by deceive?

11:57.690 --> 11:59.300
It's true, isn't it?

11:59.300 --> 12:01.450
Although there's no going back anymore...

12:01.740 --> 12:05.780
Shouldn't we at least leave it as "play with Santa" or something instead of going so far?

12:05.780 --> 12:08.530
Everyone is trying their best.

12:08.530 --> 12:10.740
We've come this far already.

12:10.740 --> 12:13.870
If you're going to complain so much, why don't you just quit?

12:14.380 --> 12:17.110
You're right. Then, I will.

12:17.700 --> 12:23.360
Kanata, do you perhaps think that it's bad for the son of a monk to dress up as Santa?

12:23.360 --> 12:25.340
Is that why you're making up all these reasons to quit?

12:25.340 --> 12:26.990
That might be part of it.

12:26.990 --> 12:30.900
I don't like wearing bright red flashy clothes like this either.

12:30.900 --> 12:32.100
I don't feel comfortable in this.

12:35.490 --> 12:36.400
What's with him?

12:51.910 --> 12:54.710
Ah, how's Miss Momoka?

12:54.710 --> 12:57.600
She finally fell asleep.

12:57.600 --> 12:59.890
Now everything's all set.

12:59.890 --> 13:03.550
Well about that, we're still waiting for our other reindeer to arrive!

13:05.470 --> 13:08.410
Mikan-san, we were waiting for you!

13:08.410 --> 13:12.140
All right! Now, we're almost ready! We can now...

13:12.610 --> 13:14.080
Everyone, you've got to help me!

13:14.080 --> 13:15.910
I'm not going to make my deadline otherwise!

13:19.950 --> 13:20.420
What!?

13:22.420 --> 13:23.570
What's this?

13:23.850 --> 13:24.900
Paint this in.

13:24.900 --> 13:25.870
Use whiteout for that part.

13:25.870 --> 13:27.250
Erase that.

13:27.250 --> 13:29.750
Shikada-san, you can't just redraw it!

13:29.750 --> 13:30.560
Okay...

13:30.560 --> 13:32.890
Then again, this is funnier.

13:32.890 --> 13:34.890
Let's go with this then.

13:34.890 --> 13:36.500
Thank you.

13:48.010 --> 13:49.380
What should I do?

13:49.380 --> 13:53.180
I've got to hurry up and inform everyone that Kanata went home.

13:55.060 --> 13:57.350
S-Something's there...

14:01.620 --> 14:02.940
Oh, Oba-tan...

14:03.400 --> 14:05.820
Oh, Momoka-chan.

14:05.820 --> 14:08.160
What are you doing here, Oba-tan?

14:08.500 --> 14:10.990
Um... Err...

14:11.410 --> 14:13.950
I see, the surprise party.

14:14.330 --> 14:15.050
What?

14:15.050 --> 14:16.710
It's nothing.

14:16.710 --> 14:19.740
Momoka needs the bathroom.

14:19.740 --> 14:21.170
The bathroom?

14:24.480 --> 14:26.550
After you're finished with the bathroom, go straight to bed, okay?

14:26.550 --> 14:27.990
Okay.

14:28.590 --> 14:32.580
I've got to find someone to play Santa...

14:33.370 --> 14:36.220
But Kanata's wearing the costume!

14:36.220 --> 14:40.280
At this point, I  have no choice, even one of Chris-chan's red dresses will do.

14:40.280 --> 14:46.900
But I'm not sure how to get back to the room where everyone is unless I look at a map every so often...

14:46.900 --> 14:48.650
Chris-chan's house is so big...

14:49.190 --> 14:50.650
Everyone, listen up!

14:51.370 --> 14:53.010
H-Hey!

14:53.010 --> 14:54.560
Everyone, what's happened?

14:54.560 --> 14:56.370
What's going on?

14:56.750 --> 14:59.110
Mikan-san! Mikan-san! Wake up!

15:00.290 --> 15:01.710
She's asleep.

15:01.710 --> 15:04.440
What should I do?! At this rate, we won't make it in time!

15:04.440 --> 15:07.050
Wanya! Wake up! Wanya!

15:08.200 --> 15:10.080
Miyu-san, what's the matter?

15:10.080 --> 15:12.120
That's what I'd like to know!

15:12.120 --> 15:13.360
Oba-tan!

15:13.360 --> 15:15.740
Yes! I'm coming!

15:18.020 --> 15:20.470
Momoka-chan! Momoka-chan!

15:26.950 --> 15:32.380
Santa-san, Momoka wants a ride in Santa's sleigh at night.

15:33.260 --> 15:34.470
It's really cold.

15:34.470 --> 15:35.450
Momoka-chan.

15:35.450 --> 15:37.800
Momoka-chan, you'll catch a cold.

15:37.800 --> 15:38.980
Let's go inside.

15:38.980 --> 15:42.390
No! Momoka's waiting for Santa-san.

15:42.390 --> 15:43.400
But...

15:43.400 --> 15:44.670
Wanya!

15:46.150 --> 15:47.150
Wanya...

15:47.150 --> 15:51.070
I'm a scarf. I'll keep you warm, Momoka-san.

15:51.670 --> 15:53.240
Thank you.

15:53.240 --> 15:55.140
It's warm.

16:26.210 --> 16:29.690
I wonder if I should've pretended to be Santa after all...

16:35.970 --> 16:38.100
S-Santa Claus?!

16:40.890 --> 16:43.850
I must've imagined it, right?

16:48.170 --> 16:49.750
This flashiness...

16:51.690 --> 16:52.820
Could it be...

16:56.110 --> 16:57.870
Merry Christmas!

16:57.870 --> 16:59.920
We've come again!

16:59.920 --> 17:01.950
I'm Yaboshi Seiya from the planet Sharaku!

17:02.410 --> 17:04.040
And I'm his older sister, Rui!

17:04.500 --> 17:05.500
I thought so.

17:05.500 --> 17:09.830
You're thinking that we're a merry pair of siblings, aren't you?

17:09.830 --> 17:11.420
Well, it's fine to think that!

17:11.420 --> 17:15.280
It says that Earth has a wonderful custom called Christmas here.

17:15.280 --> 17:20.100
Furthermore, it says this Santa Claus person scatters presents everywhere!

17:20.100 --> 17:26.650
So, we decided to dress up as Santa Claus and give presents to everyone!

17:26.650 --> 17:28.810
Huh? Are you alone, Kanata-kun?

17:28.810 --> 17:31.190
Where are Miyu-chan, Wanya, Ruu-kun, and Pepo?

17:31.570 --> 17:33.650
Could you two help me with something?

17:35.420 --> 17:38.800
I probably said too much to Kanata.

17:38.800 --> 17:44.290
But I know what it's like to not have your family around you when you want them to be there.

17:44.290 --> 17:48.410
That's why I want to grant Momoka-chan's wish no matter what.

17:48.850 --> 17:52.420
I'm sure Chris-chan feels the same too.

17:52.420 --> 17:54.650
And Kanata too...

17:57.510 --> 18:00.720
Kanata... isn't picking up...

18:08.560 --> 18:11.260
It could just be as Kanata said.

18:11.260 --> 18:15.020
It'd be impossible to lie to her year after year.

18:15.760 --> 18:20.010
In that case, it might be better to tell Momoka-chan the truth.

18:21.080 --> 18:23.830
Right, I'll tell her...

18:25.790 --> 18:27.750
Santa-san!

18:32.150 --> 18:33.750
M-Merry Christmas!

18:34.100 --> 18:36.260
Momoka-chan, I've come to fetch you.

18:36.260 --> 18:40.030
I'm Santa Claus. Sorry to have kept you waiting.

18:41.180 --> 18:42.980
K-Kanata?

18:44.390 --> 18:47.030
I'm so glad, Momoka-san.

18:47.030 --> 18:49.660
Santa-san's come for you.

18:50.480 --> 18:52.190
Merry Christmas!

18:52.510 --> 18:53.900
Seiya-kun! Rui-san!

18:53.900 --> 18:55.860
Now, come over here.

19:02.570 --> 19:05.830
Now, let's begin our ride through the sky!

19:05.830 --> 19:07.000
Okay!

20:10.230 --> 20:12.300
Bye then, Momoka-chan.

20:12.300 --> 20:13.900
Santa-san, thank you!

20:14.240 --> 20:15.470
Santa-san, here.

20:15.470 --> 20:16.360
Yaboshi...

20:18.360 --> 20:20.490
Merry Christmas!

20:23.870 --> 20:27.180
It's a present from Santa-san, Ruu-kun.

20:27.180 --> 20:27.990
Santa-san?

20:30.750 --> 20:32.600
Oh no!

20:35.580 --> 20:37.200
What's that?

20:37.200 --> 20:38.180
Momoka-chan!

20:38.180 --> 20:39.300
Wanya!

20:41.470 --> 20:42.600
Momoka-chan...

20:42.600 --> 20:43.770
Chris-oneechan,

20:43.770 --> 20:46.610
Momoka went on a ride with Santa!

20:46.610 --> 20:48.350
I even got a present!

20:49.260 --> 20:51.100
Everyone's got something.

20:51.100 --> 20:54.850
Amazing! It's a cotton candy maker!

20:57.520 --> 21:00.690
Seiya-kun definitely has the wrong festival in mind.

21:00.690 --> 21:07.080
I don't really understand, but I'm fine as long as Momoka-chan's happy.

21:07.080 --> 21:07.870
Exactly.

21:18.000 --> 21:21.950
Kanata! If you're slow, we'll be late! Late!

21:21.950 --> 21:25.120
What are you talking about? I'm already ready!

21:25.120 --> 21:27.630
It's because you take so long that we're late!

21:27.630 --> 21:29.800
You're the one who needs to speed up!

21:29.800 --> 21:36.930
It seems that there's a surprise birthday party for Kanata at Chris-chan's house today.

21:37.850 --> 21:40.770
Let's dress you up too, Ruu-chama.

21:40.770 --> 21:42.190
Kouzuki Miyu-san.

21:42.190 --> 21:43.150
Coming!

21:43.150 --> 21:44.990
It's a package from America.

21:45.350 --> 21:46.860
It's from Papa and Mama.

21:46.860 --> 21:48.620
I wonder what it is.

21:48.910 --> 21:50.120
What is this?

21:50.120 --> 21:52.120
NASA's mascot or something?

21:52.120 --> 21:53.460
How weird.

21:53.460 --> 21:54.590
Good for you.

21:54.590 --> 21:57.260
Ah, and Saionji Kanata-san.

21:57.260 --> 21:59.250
It's a Christmas card from India.

21:59.250 --> 22:04.420
Yay! Merry Christmas! Are you having fun?!

22:04.420 --> 22:07.100
What do you mean by "Yay"?

22:07.100 --> 22:10.390
Furthermore, the chief monk of a temple sending Christmas cards...

22:10.700 --> 22:12.060
Isn't it nice?

22:12.060 --> 22:15.100
A delivery from Planet Tsuuhan.

22:15.420 --> 22:17.050
This is strange.

22:17.050 --> 22:20.110
I haven't ordered anything recently, and everything else has arrived already.

22:20.110 --> 22:24.000
Nope, nope. We definitely received an order for a present.

22:24.000 --> 22:27.650
We were told to deliver it to Ruu-sama at this address.

22:27.650 --> 22:29.300
To Ruu-chama?

22:29.300 --> 22:30.070
Bye!

22:30.840 --> 22:34.290
I'm going to check with Planet Tsuuhan again later,

22:34.290 --> 22:37.410
so please don't open it yet, Ruu-chama.

22:40.330 --> 22:41.790
Something fell out.

22:42.710 --> 22:44.660
It's from Ruu's papa and mama.

22:45.930 --> 22:53.660
Th-That means that Ruu-chama's parents contacted Planet Tsuuhan and ordered this present for him!

22:53.660 --> 22:57.600
But if their transmissions are reaching Planet Tsuuhan,

22:58.100 --> 23:04.880
Ruu-chama's parents and the rescue team from Planet Otto must be getting closer to Earth.

23:05.390 --> 23:07.180
That's what this means.

24:29.940 --> 24:59.960
Next Episode

24:31.980 --> 24:36.760
The "Oh! It's almost over!" feeling at the end of the year is exciting, isn't it?

24:36.760 --> 24:38.910
And there are lots of things that suddenly come up

24:38.910 --> 24:40.000
that you want to clear before the end of the year.

24:40.000 --> 24:42.350
Hey! An old man with a long head!

24:42.350 --> 24:43.630
Whoa! His head is long.

24:43.630 --> 24:44.520
It is long.

24:44.520 --> 24:47.460
Next time on Daa Daa Daa: Delighted with the Seven Deities of Good Luck.

24:47.460 --> 24:49.160
There's no toshikoshi soba?!

24:47.460 --> 24:52.500
[Note: Toshikoshi soba is eaten at the end of the year for good luck.]

24:49.160 --> 24:52.500
All of the food for New Year has been eaten!

24:54.010 --> 24:59.960
Delighted with the Seven Deities of Good Luck.

24:55.180 --> 24:56.990
We give up...
